Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:48.96,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}梅德韦杰夫 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}7{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 卢布列夫 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a great tournament fun fun one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,是很棒的一届比赛 很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:05.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Some good matches. Felt some good tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,打了几场好球 感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and today I served pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我的发球也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:09.06,EN,,0,0,0,,So really happy about it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,对此我很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah happy happy to get the title
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,能拿到冠军 真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.86,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's really something meaningful for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对你来说也很有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to play against your compatriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,和自己的同胞交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,You had a previous experience of taking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你此前也曾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,on him in a final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在决赛中和他交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:24.30,EN,,0,0,0,,And you won that one and also you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且赢下了那场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:28.30,EN,,0,0,0,,are the one who stands in this final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,这次你也成为决赛的赢家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.46,EN,,0,0,0,,So how does this final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么这场决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:32.24,EN,,0,0,0,,mean to you? Yeah, I mean, it's never easy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有何意义？ 这从来都不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.76,EN,,0,0,0,,to play someone from your country there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,和自己国家的球员比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.06,EN,,0,0,0,,is always tiny bit more on the line even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,总会比平时更在意一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:38.42,EN,,0,0,0,,if in the end we don't care whoever you play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,虽然说到底 无论对手是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:39.40,EN,,0,0,0,,the final you want to win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进决赛 你就想赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.10,EN,,0,0,0,,but there's tiny bit more on the line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,但和同胞交手 还是更在意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:42.66,EN,,0,0,0,,so for sure a lot more nerves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:42.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以肯定会更加紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think I handled it well. I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己处理得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.24,EN,,0,0,0,,played good in important moments
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,关键时刻 我打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.24,0:00:50.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm really happy about my level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.24,0:00:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对自己的表现很满意
